<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-SPAIN BEAT GERMANY 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN BEAT GERMANY 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MALLORCA, Spain 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain beat Germany 4-1</p>
<p>after winning both reverse singles in their Davis Cup tennis</p>
<p>World Group, first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Spanish names first):</p>
<p>Carlos Moya beat Hendrik Dreekman  6-4 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Alberto Costa beat Marc Goellner 2-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-1</p>
</text>
